    {
        "content": "<p>Not sure what's going on exactly but you can see the trace by doing <code>set_option trace.Meta.whnf true</code> and looking for <code>Non-easy whnf: (\"12345%d\".toList.parseF?.get ?m.2).type ▶</code> in the trace</p>",
